    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description>Tutanota is the world's most secure email service, easy to use and private by design. Sign up for free encrypted email now.

With end-to-end encryption and 2FA, your emails have never been more secure. The built-in encryption guarantees that your mailbox belongs to you: Nobody can decrypt or read your data.

**Please Note**: This is an automatically updated package. If you find it is out of date by more than a day or two, please contact the maintainer(s) and let them know the package is no longer updating correctly.</description>
    <summary>Tutanota is an email client with a strong focus on security and privacy that lets you encrypt emails on all your devices.</summary>
    <releaseNotes>## What's new
 - The folder column on the mail view can now be resized
 - Enable HTTP/2 [#11432](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11432)

# Bugfixes
 - Remove "mail-editor" chunk dependence on "date" chunk [#11391](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11391)
 - "GMT Standard Time" time zone not mapped to "Europe/London" [#11509](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11509)
 - Using date-picker to move event from 31. to date in next month that does not have 31 days selects wrong day [#11470](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11470)
 - Improve connection reliability with autoselect family - [#11508](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11508) [#11402](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11402) [#9536](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/9536) [#8921](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/8921) [#8635](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/8635) [#8488](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/8488) [#8311](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/8311) [#7709](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/7709) [#11378](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11378) [#11286](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11286) [#10410](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/10410) [#5889](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/5889) thanks @ArminShupuk for investigation
 - Clear entry from KeyCache if KeyLoader fails - [#11501](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11501)
 - Restore compatibility with web views not supporting Intl.DurationFormat

